prompt:
Create one highest-quality polished native Flutter mobile app SETTINGS screen for the Chinese bookkeeping app 好好记账, matched to the attached existing 好好绿 theme. A single flat portrait viewport approximately 393 x 852 logical pixels rendered at high resolution, no phone frame, no perspective or external annotations. Cream #FBFCF7 background, muted green #76A33A accent, dark #1E241C text, simple consistent outline icons, soft white group surfaces, subtle gray-green dividers. Accurate readable Chinese labels. Native commercially credible interface, compact typography and generous tap targets.

This is a secondary 设置 page reached from the 我的 page gear. Top native app bar: left back chevron, centered title 设置. NO bottom navigation dock and NO floating plus button. The content is three calm grouped lists, not decorative dashboard cards.

Section 账号与数据 contains FOUR navigable rows:
账号管理, small subtitle 登录信息 · 密码 · 登录设备;
备份与数据, subtitle 云备份 · 本地备份 · 导入导出;
自动记账, subtitle 记账模式 · 授权状态;
安全与隐私, subtitle 应用锁 · 权限管理 · 隐私偏好.
Each row has a simple muted-green outline icon at left and a right chevron.

Section 应用偏好 contains TWO rows:
外观与显示, small subtitle 主题 · 深浅模式 · 金额显示, right value 好好绿 and chevron;
通知与提醒, subtitle 系统通知 · 记账提醒, right chevron.

Section 帮助与关于 contains TWO rows:
帮助与反馈, subtitle 使用说明 · 提交反馈 · 我的工单;
关于与协议, subtitle 应用版本 · 隐私政策 · 用户协议.
Chevron at right. Keep the legal documents reachable and meaningful.

Fit all eight rows, three subtle section headings and top app bar within a coherent first portrait viewport. Do not add membership upsells, ledger business tools, installment tools, finance tools, recommendation ads, developer implementation documentation, debug controls, fake switches, or security claims. This page must read as a practical consolidated settings directory.
